- **`MatrixChainSolver`** — made `solve()` and all helpers `static`, added `validateChain()` to catch incompatible adjacent matrices (previously silently computed wrong answers), private constructor prevents pointless instantiation, removed redundant `n` parameter from `buildDimsArray`
- **`MatrixChainCli`** — updated to call `MatrixChainSolver.solve()` directly
- **`MatrixChainMultiplication`** — deleted; it was a one-line wrapper with no callers outside the test
- **`MatrixChainMultiplicationTest`** — migrated off `MatrixChainMultiplication`, updated all solver calls to static form, added `testIncompatibleChain()` covering the new validation

